      "message": "Rather than a macro, would it be possible to do this with a trait? Something like\n\n```rust\npub trait SetFrom\u003cT\u003e {\n    fn set_from(\u0026mut self, value: T);\n}\n\nimpl SetFrom\u003cu64\u003e for SmcReturn {\n    fn set_from(\u0026mut self, value: u64) {\n        self.used \u003d 1;\n        self.values[0] \u003d value;\n    }\n}\n```\n\nAnd so on for the other relevant primitive and array types, like the `From` implementations we had before.",
